Texture sources and licences
============================

assets/textures/ground/*  (dirt, grass, mud, fallow, plowed, stubble, rubble: *_c.jpg albedo, *_n.png slope/height/roughness)
  Generated procedurally by tools/textures/gen_ground.py (periodic FFT noise, periodic Voronoi clods, wrapped
  blade / pebble strokes) for this project. No third-party images or scans are used. Licence: same as the project.
  (ASSETS_SPEC.md: self-made content only, so no ambientCG / Poly Haven material was downloaded.)

assets/textures/*_albedo / _normal / _orm (asphalt, concrete, brick, curb, track, crater; older dirt, grass, rubble,
plowed, stubble, fallow kept as stand-ins) -- generated by the project's own scripts (tools/textures, tools/blender).
